Box 52938, URGENT: the owner's plan said „ზურაბ ნოტაძე და გია საბაჟო
ბროკერი, ორივე საბაჟო გაფორმებასთანაა დაკავშირებული". The owner holds no
label or fact for Zurab; search_by_tag „საბაჟო" returned him only through
his OWN profile (profession „საბაჟო გაფორმება"), and the model stated it.
§110.6 made such members findable on the condition that the text „ranks the
search only and is never shown to the asker"; nothing told the model so,
and b986aea's found_by_their_own_work flag invited the statement.

Reverting the flag alone would not close it — the row itself, in a customs
search, is the fact. Both commits are reverted:
- b986aea feat(search): a row found by the member's own work says so (§111.2)
- 0148c6a feat(search): a member is found by his own work (§110.6)

They come back together with a model-facing sentence that forbids saying
why such a person was found, once Misho approves its exact text.

